        <mxCell id="p2-note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fontFamily=Tahoma;" value="&lt;b&gt;Delete rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deleting a student deletes their club requests and push devices. Deleting a club deletes its club_category rows. Deleting an event leaves its notice jobs and empties their event_id, because each job keeps its own copy of the title, body, and categories.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Security&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every new table has row-level security on with no policies, as in D1, so only our server&#x27;s secret key can read or write them." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="330" x="400" y="470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
